---
import "../styles/analog-future.css";
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Mythadis — Internet Claims. Actual Experiments.</title>
<meta name="description" content="Project Final Frontier — Analog Future V2 prototype for Mythadis.">

</head>
<body>
<a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<div class="shell">
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="brand-wrap">
      <div class="brand">MYTHADIS</div>
      <div class="tagline">INTERNET CLAIMS. ACTUAL EXPERIMENTS.</div>
    </div>
    <nav class="top-nav" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#watch">WATCH</a>
      <a href="#cases">CLAIMS</a>
      <a href="#evidence">EVIDENCE</a>
      <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
      <a href="#submit">SUBMIT</a>
      <span class="socials" aria-label="Social platforms — links coming soon"><span aria-label="YouTube">▶</span><span aria-label="Rumble">R</span><span aria-label="X">𝕏</span><span aria-label="Threads">◉</span><span aria-label="LinkedIn">in</span></span>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" id="watch">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="hero-kicker">EPISODE 017</div>
        <h1>THE<br><span class="internet-word">INTERNET</span><br>SAID <em>WHAT?</em></h1>
        <div class="episode-no">CASE 017</div>
        <div class="episode-title">Can $68 Really Become $6,732 Overnight Using AI?</div>
        <button class="primary-cta" type="button" disabled aria-label="Watch the investigation — mock episode, video coming soon"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> WATCH THE INVESTIGATION →</button>
      </div>

      <div class="media-stage">

        <aside class="side-slogan">SAME<br>CLAIMS.<br>REAL<br>TESTS.<br>DIFFERENT<br>RESULTS.</aside>

        <div class="tv-wrap" role="img" aria-label="Retro television showing a mock featured episode; video coming soon">
          <div class="screen-bezel">
            <div class="screen">
              <div class="host-silhouette" aria-hidden="true"></div>
              <div class="play" aria-hidden="true">▶</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="controls" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="dial"></div>
            <div class="dial"></div>
            <div class="speaker"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bs-card">
          <small>BS METER</small>
          <div class="bs-score">9.4<span>/10</span></div>
          <div class="bs-verdict">ABSOLUTE NONSENSE</div>
        </div>

        <div class="badge"><span>MYTHADIS</span></div>
        <div class="small-slogan">A MORE<br>SKEPTICAL<br>TOMORROW.</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="latest" id="cases">
      <div class="latest-title">
        <h2>Latest Episodes</h2>
        <a href="#cases">VIEW ALL →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="episode-strip">
        <article class="episode-card ai">
          <span class="ep">016</span>
          <h3>AI Writes Legal Contracts?</h3>
          <div class="score">BS 8.7</div>
        </article>
        <article class="episode-card game">
          <span class="ep">015</span>
          <h3>Make a Full Game in 5 Minutes?</h3>
          <div class="score">BS 9.1</div>
        </article>
        <article class="episode-card stock">
          <span class="ep">014</span>
          <h3>Predict Next Week's Stock Prices?</h3>
          <div class="score">BS 7.8</div>
        </article>
        <article class="episode-card crypto">
          <span class="ep">013</span>
          <h3>Crypto Bot Prints Money?</h3>
          <div class="score">BS 10.2</div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bottom-grid" id="submit" aria-label="Submit, follow and manifesto">
      <div class="submit-block">
        <div class="globe" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="submit-copy">
          <b>SEEN A SUSPICIOUS CLAIM?</b>
          <span>SEND IT TO THE LAB.</span>
        </div>
        <button class="submit-btn" type="button" disabled aria-label="Submit a claim — submissions coming soon">SUBMIT A CLAIM →</button>
      </div>
      <div class="follow">
        <b>FOLLOW MYTHADIS</b>
        <div class="follow-icons" aria-label="Social platforms — links coming soon"><span aria-label="YouTube">▶</span><span aria-label="Rumble">R</span><span aria-label="X">𝕏</span><span aria-label="Threads">◉</span><span aria-label="LinkedIn">in</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="manifesto">INTERNET<br>CLAIMS.<br>ACTUAL<br>EXPERIMENTS.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="evidence-band" id="evidence">
      <div class="evidence-left">
        <h2>SHOW<br>THE<br>RECEIPTS.</h2>
        <p>Every investigation publishes the claim, the test, what happened, and the evidence behind the verdict.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="evidence-right">
        <article class="receipt">
          <small>CASE 017 / EVIDENCE FILE</small>
          <h3>The claim promised a 9,800% return overnight.</h3>
          <p>We reproduced the sales funnel, traced the steps, recorded the outputs and documented every point where the story stopped matching reality.</p>
          <div class="stamp-row">
            <span class="stamp">CLAIM CAPTURED</span>
            <span class="stamp">TEST COMPLETE</span>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="receipt">
          <small>FINAL DISPOSITION</small>
          <h3>Result: the mechanism did not survive contact with reality.</h3>
          <p>Full evidence, notes and source material would live here on the production investigation page.</p>
          <div class="stamp-row">
            <span class="stamp">RECEIPTS INCLUDED</span>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer" id="about">
    <span>PROJECT FINAL FRONTIER / ANALOG FUTURE V2.3</span>
    <span>MYTHADIS // A MORE SKEPTICAL TOMORROW</span>
  </footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
